    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, i guess. but it feels a bit weird to just hand over a huge chunk of cash to some random company and hope they do the right thing. like, how do i know they won't just disappear with it or something? what's actually stopping them from just keeping the money?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
